# The page bar at 320x480 (profile p320; study portrait-320, PR-C+D, owner decisions 2026-11-03): 40 px bar, the Esc 44x30 at
# the left edge with a 54x40 tap area, no page title, the status strip as on the home grid. Settings root, the Screen
# section, Esc by its button and by a tap at the edge of its tap area (x 6, y 2) and the other edge (x 57, y 38).
# `header` checks the strip rectangle against the home grid's and that no label stands at the title origin.
# Golden at 320x480 only.
title p320 bar
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
config dark_time 60
home
header home
launch Settings
wait 300
shot p320_bar_root
key ENTER
wait 300
shot p320_bar_screen
header p320_bar_screen
expect_text "DarkTime"
tapbutton Esc
wait 300
shot p320_bar_back_button
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_text "DarkTime"
tap 6 2
wait 300
shot p320_bar_back_edge
key ENTER
wait 300
tap 57 38
wait 300
shot p320_bar_back_edge2
